OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FGale force
OL,6,Fgusts possible as a burst of blustery
OL,7,Fshowers passes through during the
OL,8,Fevening. Becoming dry for most in the
OL,9,Fearly evening with only the odd shower
OL,10,Faround overnight. Remaining windy
OL,11,Fthroughout.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FSunny spells and perhaps the
OL,14,Fodd shower. Feeling cold in the
OL,15,Fstrong, potentially disruptive winds,
OL,16,Fthough these will ease to a brisk and
OL,17,Fblustery breeze by the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
