OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FOn
OL,6,FMonday, heavy rain will pass followed
OL,7,Fby strong winds and coastal gales.
OL,8,FWindier still on Tuesday, but sunnier
OL,9,Fwith scattered showers. On Wednesday,
OL,10,Fbright and breezy with isolated
OL,11,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
